* And fixing the pin list would still not validate the shipped part:
*   1. THREE cells (XCA/XCB/XCC).  The die has TWO: 3 cells fails
*      placement (STATUS.md 2).
*   2. The couplings below are hand-sized, geometry-ratioed mirror legs
*      (XGOGB W=4.192, XPAB W=11.942, ...) -- continuous and exact.  The
*      die's couplings are 4-bit signed radix-4 MDACs: 16 levels, LSB
*      1/4 unit, full scale 3.75 units.  Quantisation is not modelled
*      here AT ALL.
*   3. The mdac include below is mdac_weight.inc, the 3-DIGIT THERMOMETER
*      part (and it is pulled in only for mdac_div inside ptat_bias).
*      The silicon is mdac_weight_d2.inc, 2-DIGIT BINARY.
* Re-running this deck re-measures the same non-shipped circuit; it
