.lib /Users/cteusche/.ciel/sky130A/libs.tech/ngspice/sky130.lib.spice tt

VDD vdd 0 3.3
* ptatbias grew from 4 pins to 8 when the rail divider and the shared MDAC
* reference chain moved into it; this deck still called the old 4-pin
* version, so the chain has not actually been simulated since that rework.
* vrefb/ve now come from raildrv, which buffers the divider taps.
XBIAS vdd pbias nd12 nd055 vcasc vgu vg4 vg16 ptatbias
XRD   vdd pbias nd12 nd055 vrefb ve raildrv
XLMON nmon pbias vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 W=4 L=8
VMON nmon 0 1.0

* bench input: x as current into cell A's v-node (beta_A = 1 direct)
IX 0 nva_in 0.5u

* ---- cells ----
XCA nua nva_in outa vdd vrefb ve pbias emlcell_b
XCB nub nvb_in outb vdd vrefb ve pbias emlcell_b
XCC nuc nvc_in outc vdd vrefb ve pbias emlcell_b
VOUTC outc 0 0.9

XPUA nua pbias vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 W=24.000 L=8
XPSAV fAV pbias vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_g5v0d10v5 W=8.000 L=8
VSPAV fAV ndAV 0
XN1AV ndAV ndAV 0 0 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_g5v0d10v5 W=16 L=2
